description = "A cycle-accurate NES / Famicom core written entirely in Swift. Dot-based PPU, cycle-stepped 6502 with DMA timing, full APU with expansion audio (VRC6, Sunsoft 5B, MMC5), 36 mapper numbers including MMC1-5, VRC2/4/6 and FME-7, NES Zapper (tap the screen to shoot, or a light gun), Four Score, Scale2x/3x/4x upscaling, band-limited alias-free audio, Game Genie and raw cheats, deterministic save states, NTSC/PAL/Dendy timing, a palette decoded from measured 2C02G composite levels, and RetroAchievements memory maps."
